{"id":"b3e7acac0acc571b","group":"17","path":"17/17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem.md","title":"Countable Downward Löwenheim–Skolem Property","display":"df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem — Countable Downward Löwenheim–Skolem Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Model Theory (Chang & Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)","book_abbrev":"17","label":"17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem","aliases":["17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem"],"display":"df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem — Countable Downward Löwenheim–Skolem Property","depends_on":["[[17-df-abstract-logic]]","[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]"],"label_origin":"local-descriptive","source_verification":"local reconstruction from supplied book-17 usage; not a transcription of missing upstream files"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Model Theory (Chang &amp; Keisler, 3rd ed. 1990)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"17"},{"key":"label","html":"17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem — Countable Downward Löwenheim–Skolem Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"48d3ae3ee6d03d67\" href=\"?note=48d3ae3ee6d03d67\" title=\"17-df-abstract-logic\">17-df-abstract-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a></span></div>"},{"key":"label_origin","html":"local-descriptive"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"local reconstruction from supplied book-17 usage; not a transcription of missing upstream files"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathscr L\">\\(\\mathscr L\\)</span> 为 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"48d3ae3ee6d03d67\" href=\"?note=48d3ae3ee6d03d67\" title=\"17-df-abstract-logic\">17-df-abstract-logic</a> 的固定语义接口；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V=\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\">\\(\\mathcal V=\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sym}(L)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"e8f9375543fc2e7d\" href=\"?note=e8f9375543fc2e7d\" title=\"17-df-language-cardinality\">17-df-language-cardinality</a>；集合基数与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0c4dd6e6f689f962\" href=\"?note=0c4dd6e6f689f962\" title=\"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic\">17-df-cardinal-arithmetic</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DownLS}\">\\(\\operatorname{DownLS}\\)</span> 在本册明确表示可数语言中可数可满足理论的可数模型性质；允许有限模型，“可数”指基数至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\aleph_0\">\\(\\aleph_0\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DownLS}(\\mathscr L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall L\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq S_{\\mathscr L}(L)\\;\n\\Bigl[&amp;|\\operatorname{Sym}(L)|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land|\\Gamma|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\operatorname{SatSet}_{\\mathscr L}(L,\\Gamma)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\bigl(\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak M|\\,\\bigr|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Gamma\\;E_{\\mathscr L}(L,\\mathfrak M,\\sigma)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DownLS}(\\mathscr L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall L\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq S_{\\mathscr L}(L)\\;\n\\Bigl[&amp;|\\operatorname{Sym}(L)|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land|\\Gamma|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\operatorname{SatSet}_{\\mathscr L}(L,\\Gamma)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\bigl(\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak M|\\,\\bigr|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Gamma\\;E_{\\mathscr L}(L,\\mathfrak M,\\sigma)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>不声称任意不可数理论都有可数模型；例如给不可数多个常元逐对加不等式会违反这种错误加强。这里的语言和理论可数性属于正式定义，而非说明中的限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"17-df-abstract-logic","status":"resolved","id":"48d3ae3ee6d03d67","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"e8f9375543fc2e7d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-language-cardinality]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-abstract-logic","status":"resolved","id":"48d3ae3ee6d03d67","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathscr L$ 为 [[17-df-abstract-logic]] 的固定语义接口；$\\mathcal V=\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$。$\\operatorname{Sym}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]；集合基数与 $\\aleph_0$ 见 [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]。$\\operatorname{DownLS}$ 在本册明确表示可数语言中可数可满足理论的可数模型性质；允许有限模型，“可数”指基数至多 $\\aleph_0$。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-language-cardinality","status":"resolved","id":"e8f9375543fc2e7d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathscr L$ 为 [[17-df-abstract-logic]] 的固定语义接口；$\\mathcal V=\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$。$\\operatorname{Sym}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]；集合基数与 $\\aleph_0$ 见 [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]。$\\operatorname{DownLS}$ 在本册明确表示可数语言中可数可满足理论的可数模型性质；允许有限模型，“可数”指基数至多 $\\aleph_0$。","embed":false},{"target":"17-df-cardinal-arithmetic","status":"resolved","id":"0c4dd6e6f689f962","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathscr L$ 为 [[17-df-abstract-logic]] 的固定语义接口；$\\mathcal V=\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$。$\\operatorname{Sym}(L)$ 见 [[17-df-language-cardinality]]；集合基数与 $\\aleph_0$ 见 [[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]。$\\operatorname{DownLS}$ 在本册明确表示可数语言中可数可满足理论的可数模型性质；允许有限模型，“可数”指基数至多 $\\aleph_0$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathscr L","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V=\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sym}(L)","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DownLS}","display":false},{"tex":"\\aleph_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\operatorname{DownLS}(\\mathscr L)\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall L\\in\\mathcal V\\;\\forall\\Gamma\\subseteq S_{\\mathscr L}(L)\\;\n\\Bigl[&|\\operatorname{Sym}(L)|\\leq\\aleph_0\\land|\\Gamma|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\operatorname{SatSet}_{\\mathscr L}(L,\\Gamma)\\\\\n&\\to\\exists\\mathfrak M\\in\\mathrm{Structure}(L)\\;\n\\bigl(\\bigl|\\,|\\mathfrak M|\\,\\bigr|\\leq\\aleph_0\n\\land\\forall\\sigma\\in\\Gamma\\;E_{\\mathscr L}(L,\\mathfrak M,\\sigma)\\bigr)\\Bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1742,"backlinks":[{"id":"a9754767740127ae","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathscr L^*$ 是 [[17-df-abstract-logic]] 的固定语义接口；所有语言取本册的 $\\mathcal V=\\mathrm{FirstOrderLanguages}$。假定 $\\operatorname{RegularFO}(\\mathscr L^*)$，其同构不变性、保真一阶嵌入、经典布尔运算、约化相容、有限符号出现、保种类及元数重命名、有限支持语言相对化全部在 [[17-df-lindstrom-regularity]] 中形式定义。$\\operatorname{Compact}$ 采用 [[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]] 的全紧致性；$\\operatorname{DownLS}$ 采用 [[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]] 的可数语言可数理论版本。$\\mathrm{FO},\\leq,\\equiv$ 的精确含义见 [[17-df-abstract-logic]]。在 [[17-ax-zfc]] 元理论中工作。"},{"id":"13c73c6f79ee78a7","anchor":"ref-102","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]"},{"id":"2c98c9e634ff4b44","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[17-df-abstract-logic]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-compactness]]\n[[17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]\n[[17-df-algebraic-closure]]\n[[17-df-bound-variable]]\n[[17-df-cardinal-arithmetic]]\n[[17-df-isomorphism]]\n[[17-df-language-operations]]\n[[17-df-lindstrom-regularity]]\n[[17-df-linear-order]]\n[[17-df-ordinals-finiteness]]\n[[17-df-partial-isomorphism]]\n[[17-df-partition-relation]]\n[[17-df-set-functions]]\n[[17-df-simultaneous-substitution]]\n[[17-df-symbol-alphabet]]"},{"id":"0b9cf711d9f53336","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem|17-df-abstract-logic-lowenheim-skolem]]"}],"outgoing":["48d3ae3ee6d03d67","e8f9375543fc2e7d","0c4dd6e6f689f962"]}